  "description": "Hail is the world’s first truly women’s-specific 160 mm bike in the market. Now, with a 170 mm fork, Hail is ready to tackle even more challenging terrain Hail offers ample travel with a relaxed head angle for fearlessly confronting steep, technical terrain, up and down. And the lightweight ALUXX-SL frame is designed to balance a woman over the PowerCore bottom bracket, placing her in the right position to control steep climbs and charge technical descents. Built with women’s-specific 3F Design Philosophy and trunnion mounted Maestro suspension platform, Hail meets the demands of aggressive trail riders and enduro racers. The 27.5-inch wheel size ensures bike handling is still nimble and playful, while carrying more speed in corners and rock gardens, and provides stability when landing jumps. Hail comes in multiple amazing color and graphics schemes.",
